DESCRIPTION:Darkly comic solo show written and performed by Nikki Fagbemi (
 Netflix\, C4\, Sky Arts\, Amazon Prime)\, based on her lived experience of 
 invisible illness. Shade is a young woman with sickle cell disease whose li
 fe depends on the blood of strangers. Between hospital admissions\, emergen
 cy transfusions and a family that expects her to keep going no matter the c
 ost\, she’s become an expert at hiding her pain. But when a near-death cr
 isis and the loss of a friend force her to confront her mortality\, the cra
 cks begin to show. Unforgettable characters bring this chaotic hospital war
 d to life.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/bed-five/
